      "doc": "doc_1",
      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "God bless you and yours - your dear Parents especially and His mercy and your dear old Grandma and her good Husband. Sorry I could not have seen her before she became childish. Now all we can do for them is to remember them in our prayer and Masses. I am glad to hear from yourself - that you are still with us. I think it was when you were three the doctors would not have bet much on your living. Well, thank God for Everything ...... Very best regards and wishes to your dear Parents. I used to quite enjoy my visits over there to the West Side twenty years back. Thanks be to God, my health has been good ever since I went West for a vacation to the First Mass of my nephew in Seattle, Wash'n. It is much easier here though it is not a small job to keep the letters from accumu- lating. I am inscribing your name in my emergency list for your speedy im- provement and recovery - please God.",
      "per_polygon": "God bless you and yours - your dear Parents especially and His mercy and your dear old Grandma and her good Husband. Sorry I could not have seen her before she became childish. Now all we can do for them is to remember them in our prayer and Masses. I am glad to hear from yourself - that you are still with us. I think it was when you were three the doctors would not have bet much on your living. Well, thank God for Everything .. . Very best regards and wishes to your dear Parents. I used to quite enjoy my visits over there to the West Side twenty years back. Thanks be to God, my health has been good ever since I went West for a vacation to the First Mass of my nephew in Seattle, Wash'n. It is much easier here though it is not a small job to keep the letters from accumu- lating. I am inscribing your name in my emergency list for your speedy im- provement and recovery - please God.",
